{"turn": 8, "content": "T3 can wait in loop 1 while T2 passes through the other loop. I\u2019m holding T4 and T6 at the west end for now so they cannot meet T2 head-on on S1.", "tool_calls": [{"id": "step_7", "index": 0, "type": "function", "function": {"name": "step", "arguments": "{\"commands\": [{\"train\": \"T4\", \"action\": \"hold\"}, {\"train\": \"T6\", \"action\": \"hold\"}], \"expected_decision_id\": 5, \"request_id\": \"r5\"}"}}]}
